>>
Rule 103 (If data format is NHWC, the height and width of out_backprop should match the ones defined in the input_sizes.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : str} |= if v_3 = "NHWC" then shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1) ∧ shape(v_1, 2) = shape(v_2, 2)
>>
